-void Agc::updateExposure(IPAContext &context, IPAFrameContext &frameContext, double exposureMSV)
+/*
+ * Tuning:
+ *   maxFrameDuration: longest frame in microseconds when the exposure is
+ *     lengthened in low light (default 100000, 10 frames per second).
+ *   gainThreshold: analogue gain reached before the frame is lengthened
+ *     (default 4.0); above it, the exposure time grows first.
